var e=[{id:1,slug:`chemical-peels`,category:`Cosmetic Dermatology`,title:`Chemical Peels`,shortDescription:`Advanced clinical peels to rejuvenate skin texture and tone.`,overview:`A chemical peel is a technique used to improve and smooth the texture of the skin. Facial skin is mostly treated, and scarring can be improved.`,benefits:[`Reduced fine lines and wrinkles`,`Improved mild scars`,`Treated certain types of acne`,`Reduced age spots, freckles and dark patches`],approach:`We offer light, medium, and deep peels depending on your skin type and desired results. The solution is applied to the skin, causing it to exfoliate and eventually peel off.`,expectations:`The new, regenerated skin is usually smoother and less wrinkled than the old skin. Recovery time varies based on the depth of the peel.`,image:`/01_Chemical_Peels.png`},{id:2,slug:`laser-hair-reduction`,category:`Cosmetic Dermatology`,title:`Laser Hair Reduction`,shortDescription:`Safe, effective, and long-lasting laser hair removal solutions.`,overview:`Laser hair removal is a medical procedure that uses a concentrated beam of light (laser) to remove unwanted hair.`,benefits:[`Long-lasting results`,`Precision targeting`,`Speed of treatment`,`Reduced ingrown hairs`],approach:`Our clinic uses state-of-the-art diode and ND:YAG lasers, ensuring safe and effective hair reduction for all skin types.`,expectations:`Multiple sessions are typically required for optimal results. You may experience slight redness temporarily after the procedure.`,image:`/02_Laser Hair Reduction.png`},{id:3,slug:`acne-treatment`,category:`Medical Dermatology`,title:`Clinical Acne Treatment`,shortDescription:`Medical management of active acne and prevention strategies.`,overview:`Our medical acne treatments focus on clearing active breakouts and preventing future ones using clinically proven methods.`,benefits:[`Reduced inflammation`,`Clearer skin`,`Prevention of scarring`,`Personalized care`],approach:`We combine topical treatments, oral medications (if necessary), and clinical procedures like extractions or specialized peels.`,expectations:`Results take time, typically 4-8 weeks to see significant improvement. Consistency with the prescribed routine is key.`,image:`/03_Clinical Acne Treatment.png`},{id:4,slug:`skin-rejuvenation`,category:`Cosmetic Dermatology`,title:`Skin Rejuvenation`,shortDescription:`Comprehensive procedures to restore youthful, glowing skin.`,overview:`Skin rejuvenation encompasses various treatments designed to restore your skin's youthful appearance and treat damage.`,benefits:[`Improved skin texture`,`More even tone`,`Stimulated collagen production`,`Youthful glow`],approach:`We offer microneedling, PRP, and gentle laser treatments tailored to your specific skin concerns.`,expectations:`Depending on the procedure, there may be some downtime. The results progressively improve as collagen rebuilds.`,image:`/04_Skin Rejuvenation.png`},{id:5,slug:`eczema-care`,category:`Medical Dermatology`,title:`Eczema Care`,shortDescription:`Comprehensive management to soothe inflammation and control eczema flare-ups.`,overview:`Eczema requires a gentle, consistent approach to repair the skin barrier and reduce inflammation.`,benefits:[`Reduced itching`,`Restored skin barrier`,`Fewer flare-ups`],approach:`We prescribe specialized emollients, topical corticosteroids, and lifestyle modifications to manage eczema.`,expectations:`Consistent application of treatments will gradually restore the skin barrier and reduce symptoms.`,image:`/06_Psoriasis Management.png`},{id:6,slug:`psoriasis-management`,category:`Medical Dermatology`,title:`Psoriasis Management`,shortDescription:`Advanced biologic and topical therapies for psoriasis.`,overview:`Our psoriasis treatments aim to slow cell turnover and clear scaling, improving your quality of life.`,benefits:[`Cleared plaques`,`Reduced joint pain`,`Long-term remission`],approach:`We offer topical treatments, light therapy, and advanced biologic injectables based on disease severity.`,expectations:`Depending on the therapy, significant clearing can be achieved in a few weeks to months.`,image:`/05_Psoriasis Management.png`},{id:7,slug:`hair-loss-evaluation`,category:`Medical Dermatology`,title:`Hair Loss Evaluation`,shortDescription:`Diagnostic testing and treatment for various forms of alopecia.`,overview:`We provide thorough evaluations to determine the root cause of hair loss and prescribe effective treatments.`,benefits:[`Accurate diagnosis`,`Customized regrowth plan`,`Prevention of further loss`],approach:`Using scalp analysis and blood work, we design a plan that may include minoxidil, finasteride, or PRP therapy.`,expectations:`Hair regrowth takes time; results are typically visible after 3 to 6 months of consistent treatment.`,image:`/07_Hair Loss Evaluation.png`},{id:8,slug:`pigmentation-management`,category:`Medical Dermatology`,title:`Pigmentation Management`,shortDescription:`Medical solutions for melasma, sun spots, and uneven skin tone.`,overview:`We offer medical-grade topical treatments to safely fade hyperpigmentation and melasma.`,benefits:[`Even skin tone`,`Faded dark spots`,`Preventative care`],approach:`We prescribe hydroquinone, retinoids, or non-hydroquinone alternatives tailored to your skin type.`,expectations:`Gradual fading of dark spots over several weeks, with strict sun protection required.`,image:`/12_Pigmentation Management.png`},{id:9,slug:`skin-infection-care`,category:`Medical Dermatology`,title:`Skin Infection Care`,shortDescription:`Prompt diagnosis and treatment of bacterial, fungal, and viral skin infections.`,overview:`Rapid and accurate treatment is essential to clear skin infections and prevent complications.`,benefits:[`Fast symptom relief`,`Prevention of spreading`,`Restored skin health`],approach:`We prescribe targeted oral or topical antibiotics, antifungals, or antivirals based on a precise diagnosis.`,expectations:`Most infections begin to clear within a few days of starting the appropriate medication.`,image:`/08_Skin Infection Care.png`},{id:10,slug:`laser-treatments`,category:`Cosmetic Dermatology`,title:`Laser Treatments`,shortDescription:`State-of-the-art laser therapies for various cosmetic skin concerns.`,overview:`Our versatile laser systems can treat vascular lesions, redness, and provide overall skin rejuvenation.`,benefits:[`Targeted treatment`,`Minimal downtime`,`Stimulates collagen`],approach:`We select the appropriate laser wavelength to target specific concerns like broken capillaries or generalized redness.`,expectations:`Some redness may occur immediately post-treatment, with results improving over several weeks.`,image:`/09_Laser Treatments.png`},{id:11,slug:`acne-scar-treatment`,category:`Cosmetic Dermatology`,title:`Acne Scar Treatment`,shortDescription:`Advanced procedures to smooth and reduce the appearance of acne scarring.`,overview:`We utilize a combination of procedures to break up scar tissue and stimulate new collagen production.`,benefits:[`Smoother skin texture`,`Reduced scar depth`,`Improved self-confidence`],approach:`Treatments may include TCA cross, subcision, microneedling, or fractional laser resurfacing.`,expectations:`Multiple sessions are usually required. The skin's texture will gradually smooth out over several months.`,image:`/10_Acne Scar Treatment.png`},{id:12,slug:`pigmentation-procedures`,category:`Cosmetic Dermatology`,title:`Pigmentation Procedures`,shortDescription:`Cosmetic procedures like Q-switch lasers to eliminate stubborn pigmentation.`,overview:`For stubborn pigmentation that resists topical treatments, we offer advanced cosmetic procedures.`,benefits:[`Rapid removal of sun spots`,`Safe for various skin types`,`Clearer complexion`],approach:`We utilize targeted pigment lasers (like Q-switch or Pico lasers) and advanced chemical peels.`,expectations:`Pigment may darken initially before flaking off over a week, revealing clearer skin beneath.`,image:`/11_Pigmentation Procedures.png`}];export{e as t};